<title>USA: World Satellite names Ringstad COO.</title>
<headline>World Satellite names Ringstad COO.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>World Satellite Network Inc said Wednesday that it elected Robert Ringstad to the additional position of chief operating officer in addition to his current spot as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company also said Gary Hokkanen resigned as chief executive officer for health reasons. It entered into a six-month agreement under which Hokkanen will serve as an adviser.</p>
<p>World Satellite, a provider of satellite television programming services, also said it hired Bruce LaCoe as controller. LaCoe formerly was with Minntech Corp.</p>
<p>	    ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
